    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Effective September 4, 1996\nWORLDWIDE TIMETABLE\nТИА\n1946\nYEARS\nPURCHASE A ONE WAY, FULL COACH\nYFIRST FARE AND YOU'LL AUTOMATICALLY\nBE CONFIRMED IN FIRST CLASS.\n(SEE PAGE 7 FOR DETAILS.)\nTWA\nTRANS\n•...\nIncluding\nTrans World Express®\nService\nDomestic Reservations 1-800-221-2000\nInternational Reservations 1-800-892-4141",
      "Call 1-800-227-1471\nto Apply for the TWA® MasterCard®\nand Visa® Cards Today!\nFAB\nFIGH\n4292.\n1234 56 78\n429\nFAB\nVISA\nMY PROCLAN\nMiles\nAbove\nthe\nRest!\n5420 1234-5678\n1/94-10796\n5420\nMasterCard\nEarn FREE Travel With\nThe TWA MasterCard and Visa!*\nEarn One Mile for Every Net Purchase Dollar! Our TWA MasterCard and\nVisa cards work twice as hard! TWA and European American Bank (EABo)\noffer a credit card that rewards you with outstanding benefits and Frequent\nFlight Bonus (FFB®) miles. You'll receive one TWA FFB mile for every net\npurchase dollar charged to the card. You can exchange your FFB miles to\ntravel to exciting cities and exotic islands all over the world on TWA and its\npartner airlines!\nUnlike many other frequent flyer programs, TWA miles have no expiration\ndate. And, when you charge your TWA tickets to the card, you'll earn miles for\nevery net purchase dollar you spend PLUS travel miles.***\nTake off with a 3,000 Mile Bonus! Apply for the TWA credit card today and\nupon the first purchase with your card, we'll give you a special sign-up bonus\nof 3,000 miles.\nFREE $50 Flight Certificate! Save $50 off the first TWA ticket you charge to\nthe card (minimum published fare $250).**\nAutomatic Purchase Protection. Most new purchases and gifts charged\nentirely to the card are automatically protected against theft and accidental\ndamage for 90 days from the date of purchase, and\nextended warranty\ndoubles the manufacturer's original or store brand warranty for up to one\nadditional year.\nFirst Class Travel Benefits. Charge travel expenses to the card and enjoy\nthe added security of these benefits: Worldwide Acceptance...$150,000\nTravel Accident Insurance...Savings Up to $12 a Day on Car Rental\nInsurance. Lost or Stolen Luggage Reimbursement.. Free Credit Card\nRegistration...24-Hour Customer Information Access.\nIf you're not a member of the TWA Frequent Flight\nBonus Program, we'll automatically enroll you!\n*Subject to credit approval.\n**Minimum 14 day advance purchase required. Certificate may not\nbe used on travel originating or terminating in Europe or the\nbe completed within 30 days of departure or by date printed on\ncertificate. Seat availability is limited. Certificate may not be com-\nbined with any other certificate, offer, coupon, TWA FFB Award,\ndiscount or other offer. Additional conditions, restrictions and\nblackout dates apply and will be provided with certificate.\nTWA\n•FREQUENT\nFLIGHT\nBONUS PROGRAM\n***Miles accrued and awards issued are in accordance with the terms\nand conditions of the TWA Frequent Flight Bonus Program. Terms\nand conditions or tis rrogram will be provided upon cara mem\nbership and may be modified at any time.\nThis advertisement contains a partial description of various benefits. Additional conditions, restrictions, claim filing procedures and exclusions apply.\nFull details will be provided upon card membership. Services and benefits may be added or deleted at any time without notice to card members."
    ],
